    <string name="about_blurb">DresSecureComms is a FOSS, de-Googled, all-in-one secure communications app. It works fully offline for SMS and calls, with no trackers and no Google services. Messages can be encrypted between two people who both use this app, with a separate key for each contact. It also screens spam calls on the device and checks files against VirusTotal by fingerprint, so nothing you scan is ever uploaded.</string>
