    <string name="upload_unknown_size">unknown size</string>
    <string name="upload_confirm_title">Send this file to VirusTotal?</string>
    <string name="upload_confirm_body">%1$s (%2$s) will be uploaded to VirusTotal so their engines can analyse it. Up to now the app has only ever sent a fingerprint. This sends the file itself.\n\nVirusTotal keeps what you send, shares it with the antivirus companies it works with, and lets its paying customers download it. Only send something you are willing to make public. Never send anything private.</string>
